    <Staff id="1">
      <VBox>
        <height>20</height>
        <Text>
          <style>Title</style>
          <text>Audio compatibility C - Controller reset and ordinary bend</text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
          <style>Subtitle</style>
          <size>10</size>
          <text>Same SoundFont, dry master effects, reverb sends 0. Compare legacy Fluid and FluidSynth 2.
The bent C in C2 should reach the following D. CC121 restores controllers and releases pedals; it keeps the instrument.</text>
        </Text>
      </VBox>
      <Measure>
        <voice>
